  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n \xFCst \xE7eperlerine telveler sa\xE7\u0131lm\u0131\u015F.
    Adeta ya\u011F\u0131\u015Fl\u0131 bir g\xFCnde \xE7evreye yay\u0131lan minik
    dolu tanelerini and\u0131r\u0131yorlar. Yaln\u0131zl\u0131\u011F\u0131n sert
    ve sars\u0131c\u0131 iklimi, seni huzursuz etmeye ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015F gibi
    g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor {{isim}}. Payla\u015Fmak isteyip de payla\u015Famad\u0131klar\u0131n
    var. Ailene ve yak\u0131n arkada\u015Flar\u0131na a\xE7amad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    gizli d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerini dahi bilen, her \u015Feye birlikte \u015Fahit
    olabilece\u011Fin, tabiri yerindeyse bir \"su\xE7 orta\u011F\u0131\" istiyor
    gibisin. {{burc}} burcu oldu\u011Fun i\xE7in, i\xE7inde bulundu\u011Fumuz {{ay_0}}
    ay\u0131 do\u011Fru ki\u015Finin burcuyla \"kavu\u015Fum\" ad\u0131na uygun g\xF6z\xFCkm\xFCyor.
    {{ay_+1}} ay\u0131nda g\xF6k a\xE7\u0131lacak ve o ki\u015Finin \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    fark etmeye ba\u015Flayacaks\u0131n."
